{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:57:01+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:57:01+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Salzgitter AG","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"Germany","city":"Salzgitter","website":"https://www.salzgitter-ag.com/de","employees":23257,"summary":"Salzgitter AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in steel and technology businesses worldwide. The company operates through four segments: Steel Production, Steel Processing, Trading, and Technology. Its Steel Production segment manufactures steel and special steels, such as hot-rolled wide strip, steel sheet, sections, tailored blanks, as well as scrap trading. The Steel Processing segment produces various high-grade heavy plate products; and manufactures line pipes, HFI-welded tubes, and precision tubes. Its Trading segment operates a European sales network, as well as trading companies and agencies worldwide. The Technology segment engages in the provision of machinery and plants for the filling and packaging of beverages, as well as special machinery engineering for elastomer production. It also provides IT, facility management, logistics, automotive engineering, and research and development services, as well as supplies raw materials. The company was founded in 1858 and is headquartered in Salzgitter, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Salzgitter AG, avec ses filiales, exerce des activités sidérurgiques et technologiques dans le monde entier. La société opère à travers quatre segments: la production d'acier, la transformation de l'acier, le commerce et la technologie. Son secteur de la production d'acier fabrique de l'acier et des aciers spéciaux, tels que des bandes larges laminées à chaud, des tôles d'acier, des sections, des ébauches sur mesure, ainsi que du commerce de ferraille."},"valuation":{"market_ca